  stepId: Step_06_PromoteToDomainController
  instructionText: 'LO2.3 - Installing AD DS does not create a domain. The server
    must still be promoted.


    Click the notification flag in Server Manager >
    ''Promote this server to a domain controller'' > ''Add a new forest'', then type
    the root domain name.


    The server restarts afterwards and you sign back
    in as a domain administrator.'
